      "versionNonce": 310995910,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793995959318,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why do we need Docker Compose?",
      "rawText": "Why do we need Docker Compose?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why do we need Docker Compose?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    },
    {
      "id": "j50G8Kjk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -304.39996337890625,
      "y": -56,
      "width": 936.0194091796875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 199860250,
      "version": 109,
      "versionNonce": 1204110534,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793995996628,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> Modern applications require multiple containers like Node.js, MongoDB, PostgreSQL and Redis.\n-> Running and configuring each container separately is time-consuming.\n-> We need to manage networking, ports and environment variables individually.\n-> Docker Compose allows us to manage all containers together using a single configuration file.",
      "rawText": "-> Modern applications require multiple containers like Node.js, MongoDB, PostgreSQL and Redis.\n-> Running and configuring each container separately is time-consuming.\n-> We need to manage networking, ports and environment variables individually.\n-> Docker Compose allows us to manage all containers together using a single configuration file.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> Modern applications require multiple containers like Node.js, MongoDB, PostgreSQL and Redis.\n-> Running and configuring each container separately is time-consuming.\n-> We need to manage networking, ports and environment variables individually.\n-> Docker Compose allows us to manage all containers together using a single configuration file.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    },
    {
      "id": "TOBpphkb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -36,
      "y": 94,
      "width": 347.4798583984375,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1918801690,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 2047800858,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793996024504,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is Docker Compose?",
      "rawText": "What is Docker Compose?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is Docker Compose?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    },
    {
      "id": "yqixDK5b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -306.79998779296875,
      "y": 163.80001831054688,
      "width": 1060.5391845703125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1410200582,
      "version": 249,
      "versionNonce": 982702746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793996064794,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> Docker Compose is a tool used to define and run multi-container applications.\n-> It uses a YAML file (docker-compose.yml) to configure services, networks, volumes, ports and environment\nvariables.\n-> We can start or stop all containers using a single command.",
      "rawText": "-> Docker Compose is a tool used to define and run multi-container applications.\n-> It uses a YAML file (docker-compose.yml) to configure services, networks, volumes, ports and environment variables.\n-> We can start or stop all containers using a single command.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> Docker Compose is a tool used to define and run multi-container applications.\n-> It uses a YAML file (docker-compose.yml) to configure services, networks, volumes, ports and environment variables.\n-> We can start or stop all containers using a single command.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r5EasflT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -305,
      "y": 279.0000305175781,
      "width": 363,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 421001094,
      "version": 57,
      "versionNonce": 1236077210,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793996079634,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "name: e-commerce\n\nservices:\n  db:\n    image: postgres:16\n    container_name: postgres\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: postgres\n      POSTGRES_USER: postgres\n      POSTGRES_DB: postgres\n    ports:\n      - \"5431:5432\"\n\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    container_name: redis\n    ports:\n      - \"6379:6379\"",
      "rawText": "name: e-commerce\n\nservices:\n  db:\n    image: postgres:16\n    container_name: postgres\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: postgres\n      POSTGRES_USER: postgres\n      POSTGRES_DB: postgres\n    ports:\n      - \"5431:5432\"\n\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    container_name: redis\n    ports:\n      - \"6379:6379\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "name: e-commerce\n\nservices:\n  db:\n    image: postgres:16\n    container_name: postgres\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: postgres\n      POSTGRES_USER: postgres\n      POSTGRES_DB: postgres\n    ports:\n      - \"5431:5432\"\n\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    container_name: redis\n    ports:\n      - \"6379:6379\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    },
    {
      "id": "z9I3BCs5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 216,
      "y": 276.20001220703125,
      "width": 610.3997192382812,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1129238298,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 277190042,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793996143333,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "name: Defines the Compose project name.\nservices: Defines all containers required by the application.\ndb: Service name for PostgreSQL.\nimage: Specifies the Docker image and version.\ncontainer_name: Assigns a custom container name.\nenvironment: Sets environment variables.\nports: Maps host port to container port (HOST:CONTAINER).\nredis: Defines another service for Redis.",
      "rawText": "name: Defines the Compose project name.\nservices: Defines all containers required by the application.\ndb: Service name for PostgreSQL.\nimage: Specifies the Docker image and version.\ncontainer_name: Assigns a custom container name.\nenvironment: Sets environment variables.\nports: Maps host port to container port (HOST:CONTAINER).\nredis: Defines another service for Redis.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "name: Defines the Compose project name.\nservices: Defines all containers required by the application.\ndb: Service name for PostgreSQL.\nimage: Specifies the Docker image and version.\ncontainer_name: Assigns a custom container name.\nenvironment: Sets environment variables.\nports: Maps host port to container port (HOST:CONTAINER).\nredis: Defines another service for Redis.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    },
    {
